     "body": "<p>Note: This also applies to fedora.common.http.WebClient.</p>\n\n<p>Related: \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-437\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-437\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"usage of HTTP proxy when getting external content\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10315?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-437\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n recently made WebClient proxy-configurable.</p>",
